---
pagination:
  data: locationIndex.types
  size: 1
  alias: soort
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ soort.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ soort.plural }}"
  seo_title: "{{ soort.pluralTitle }} to Film In: {{ soort.count }} Locations Across Europe | Tubes"
  description: "{{ soort.count }} {{ soort.lower }} to shoot in across {{ soort.byCountry | length }} European countries, with photos, practical details and a link to every location."
---
{#- Typepagina: een soort plek door heel Europa, gegroepeerd per land. Mikt op
    "castles to film in", "abandoned hospital filming location" en dergelijke.
    Landen met genoeg locaties krijgen hun eigen type-en-landpagina; die staat
    hier als link boven de kaarten, zodat de bezoeker en Google verder komen.

    Per land staan hier hoogstens acht kaarten (PREVIEW in locationIndex.js)
    met een link naar de rest: anders zou "Theatres, arenas and venues" 427
    kaarten op een pagina zetten. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner has-promo">
    <div class="company-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/film-locations/">Film locations</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ soort.plural }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="/film-locations/">Directory</a></p>
      <h1>{{ soort.plural }} to film in</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">
        {{ soort.count }} of them in {{ soort.byCountry | length }} European countries, {{ soort.stats.photos }} with a photo and {{ soort.stats.practical }} with practical details the location publishes itself. Search and put three side by side in the
        <a href="/compare-film-tv-locations/">locations search</a>.
      </p>
    </header>
    {% set promoVariant = "inline" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}

    <div class="rich-text"><p>{{ soort.blurb }}</p></div>

    <h2>Where they are</h2>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for c in soort.byCountry %}
      <li><a href="{{ c.url or c.countryUrl }}">{{ c.country }} <span>{{ c.count }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    {%- for c in soort.byCountry %}
    <h2 id="{{ c.slug }}">{{ soort.plural }} in {{ c.inCountry }} <span class="company-count">{{ c.count }}</span></h2>
    {%- if c.url %}
    <p><a href="{{ c.url }}">All {{ c.count }} {{ soort.lower }} in {{ c.inCountry }}</a>, or see <a href="{{ c.countryUrl }}">every kind of location in {{ c.inCountry }}</a>.</p>
    {%- else %}
    <p>See <a href="{{ c.countryUrl }}">every kind of location in {{ c.inCountry }}</a>.</p>
    {%- endif %}
    {% set lijst = c.preview %}{% set toonLand = false %}
    {% set meerUrl = c.url or c.countryUrl if c.previewMore else null %}{% set meerLabel = "All " + c.count + " in " + c.inCountry %}
    {% include "partials/location-cards.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="/film-locations/">All types of location</a> &middot;
      <a href="/compare-film-tv-locations/">Search all {{ locationIndex.total }} locations</a>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-side">{% set promoVariant = "aside" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Turning a location into a budget?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, so travel, permits and unit days land in the budget instead of in a side spreadsheet.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
